msgstr "Conserver cette loi : gmeow:SummaryWordsSourceConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:Summary ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "runtime appraisal standpoint constraint"
msgstr "contrainte de point de vue du runtime"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A BodyDistillation records a responsible runtime Agent and offers the appraisal accordingTo that runtime. This does not turn its beneficiary into the keeper or imply beneficiary self-endorsement."
msgstr "Un BodyDistillation consigne un Agent runtime responsable et propose l’appréciation accordingTo ce runtime. Cela ne fait pas du bénéficiaire le conservateur et n’implique aucune approbation de soi."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied memory record and source bindings."
msgstr "Utiliser pour contrôler la cohérence intrinsèque de l’enregistrement mémoire fourni et de ses liens sources."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law proves access enforcement, authorship, digest computation or governed migration."
