msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain the original record and evidence when reporting an intrinsic violation; do not manufacture missing inputs."
msgstr "Conserver l’enregistrement et les preuves originales lors du signalement d’une violation intrinsèque ; ne pas fabriquer d’entrées manquantes."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "Retain this governing law: gmeow:DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:BodyDistillation ."
msgstr "Conserver cette loi : gmeow:DistillationRuntimeStandpointConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:BodyDistillation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EpochArtifactDigestConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "epoch artifact identity constraint"
msgstr "contrainte d’identité des artefacts de l’époque"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EpochArtifactDigestConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Each original artifact referenced by a CurationEpoch carries its own contentDigest. A digest on the activity description cannot substitute for artifact-byte identity."
msgstr "Chaque artefact original référencé par un CurationEpoch porte son propre contentDigest. Une empreinte de la description d’activité ne remplace pas l’identité des octets de l’artefact."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EpochArtifactDigestConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied memory record and source bindings."
msgstr "Utiliser pour contrôler la cohérence intrinsèque de l’enregistrement mémoire fourni et de ses liens sources."

