msgstr "Conserver cette loi : gmeow:EpochArtifactDigestConstraint logic:formalizes gmeow:CurationEpoch ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EpochDigestAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "epoch source digest agreement constraint"
msgstr "contrainte d’accord des empreintes sources"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EpochDigestAgreementConstraint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Every reported manifest, predecessor or archive digest is also a contentDigest on its corresponding original artifact. Multiple algorithm-labelled digests may coexist."
msgstr "Chaque empreinte rapportée de manifeste, prédécesseur ou archive est aussi un contentDigest de l’artefact original correspondant. Plusieurs algorithmes peuvent coexister."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EpochDigestAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to check intrinsic consistency of the supplied memory record and source bindings."
msgstr "Utiliser pour contrôler la cohérence intrinsèque de l’enregistrement mémoire fourni et de ses liens sources."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/EpochDigestAgreementConstraint|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid claiming this law proves access enforcement, authorship, digest computation or governed migration."
